{"2323140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ringash", "steam_appid": 2323140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "The destruction of the “The Ring” has blurred the boundary between reality and the Abyss.<br>Darkness spreads, corrupting everything in its path, and the world teeters on the brink of annihilation.<br><br>As one of the few who can resist the corruption — an Ash — you must uncover the truth behind the disaster and stop the Abyss from consuming all that remains.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323140/extras/5b3c6c25f880c1cf04823c5b0e4010f5.poster.avif?t=1775926243\" width=540 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323140/extras/5b3c6c25f880c1cf04823c5b0e4010f5.webm?t=1775926243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323140/extras/5b3c6c25f880c1cf04823c5b0e4010f5.mp4?t=1775926243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fluid, Stylish, and Expressive Combat</h2>The combat system in Ringash is built for both impact and depth.<br>Each fight isn’t just about choosing the right weapon or skill — it’s a stage for your personal style.<br>From the ground to the air, combos flow freely, and your battle approach is yours to define.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration Is More Than a Side Path — It’s Your Route</h2>Every stage is filled with shortcuts, hidden treasures, secret lore, and optional challenges.<br>Exploration doesn’t just deepen your understanding of the world — it reshapes the rhythm of your journey and unlocks alternate outcomes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Adventure Is a Story of Fate Rewritten</h2>In a world torn between fantasy and despair, your choices shape the outcome.<br>With multiple endings and narrative branches, each run tells a different story.<br>Only through repeated decisions and battles can you uncover the truth hidden within the Abyss.", "about_the_game": "The destruction of the “The Ring” has blurred the boundary between reality and the Abyss.<br>Darkness spreads, corrupting everything in its path, and the world teeters on the brink of annihilation.<br><br>As one of the few who can resist the corruption — an Ash — you must uncover the truth behind the disaster and stop the Abyss from consuming all that remains.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323140/extras/5b3c6c25f880c1cf04823c5b0e4010f5.poster.avif?t=1775926243\" width=540 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323140/extras/5b3c6c25f880c1cf04823c5b0e4010f5.webm?t=1775926243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323140/extras/5b3c6c25f880c1cf04823c5b0e4010f5.mp4?t=1775926243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fluid, Stylish, and Expressive Combat</h2>The combat system in Ringash is built for both impact and depth.<br>Each fight isn’t just about choosing the right weapon or skill — it’s a stage for your personal style.<br>From the ground to the air, combos flow freely, and your battle approach is yours to define.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration Is More Than a Side Path — It’s Your Route</h2>Every stage is filled with shortcuts, hidden treasures, secret lore, and optional challenges.<br>Exploration doesn’t just deepen your understanding of the world — it reshapes the rhythm of your journey and unlocks alternate outcomes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Adventure Is a Story of Fate Rewritten</h2>In a world torn between fantasy and despair, your choices shape the outcome.<br>With multiple endings and narrative branches, each run tells a different story.<br>Only through repeated decisions and battles can you uncover the truth hidden within the Abyss.", "short_description": "Ringash is a boss-focused ARPG featuring fast-paced combat, stylish combos and meaningful exploration. As a warrior with mystical powers, you’ll try to save a world that’s being destroyed. Seek and challenge the bosses to grow your strength. Explore and uncover the truth to shape your story.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, German, Korean, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323140/header.jpg?t=1775926243", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775926243", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775926243", "website": "https://x.com/RingashGame", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K / AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K / AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_req